<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Promotion – KodoSchool</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css?v=<%= locals.assetVersion || '' %>" />
<%- include('partials/workspace-assets') %></head>
<body class="lms-ui admin-body">
  <a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to content</a>
  <%- include('partials/admin-sidebar', { active: 'promotion' }) %>

  <div class="admin-main">
    <header class="admin-topbar">
      <div class="admin-topbar-left">
        <button id="menuToggle" class="menu-toggle" aria-label="Open menu" aria-controls="sidebar">&#x2630;</button>
        <h2 class="panel-title">Promotion</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="admin-topbar-right">
        <span id="adminInfo" class="admin-info"></span>
        <button id="topLogout" class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm">Sign out</button>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main class="admin-content pr-page" id="main-content" tabindex="-1">
      <section class="card pr-guide" aria-labelledby="prGuideTitle">
        <h2 id="prGuideTitle">How promotion works</h2>
        <p>At the end of the school year, each class moves up from its <b>annual average</b>, the same figure as on the third-term report card (the mean of the three term averages, with coefficients).</p>
        <ol class="tt-steps">
          <li><b>Before you start:</b> all marks of the three terms are entered, the third-term report cards are printed, and the next academic year exists (<a href="/admin-dashboard#registration/academic-years">Registration → Academic years</a>).</li>
          <li><b>Open a class.</b> Each student is shown with a proposed decision: <em>Promote</em> at 10/20 or more, <em>Repeat</em> below 10, <em>Graduate</em> in Upper Sixth and Terminale.</li>
          <li><b>Apply the class council's decisions.</b> Change any decision if the council decided otherwise, check the class they move to, then press <em>Apply promotion</em>.</li>
        </ol>
        <p class="muted">Promoted and repeating students are enrolled for the next academic year, so a class can only be promoted once and the classes can be done in any order. Graduates leave the class lists; their records are kept.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="card" aria-labelledby="prClassTitle">
        <h2 id="prClassTitle">Promote a class</h2>
        <form id="prForm" class="tt-filters">
          <label>Class <select id="prClass" required><option value="">Loading classes…</option></select></label>
          <label>School year ending <select id="prYear" required><option value="">Loading…</option></select></label>
          <button type="submit" class="btn" id="prLoad">Show students</button>
        </form>
        <p id="prMsg" class="msg" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>

        <div id="prResult" hidden>
          <div class="pr-summary" id="prSummary"></div>
          <div class="pr-dest" id="prDestRow">
            <label>Promoted students move to <select id="prNext"></select></label>
            <span class="muted" id="prNextYear"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="table-wrap">
            <table class="pr-table">
              <thead><tr><th>Rank</th><th>Student</th><th class="n">Term 1</th><th class="n">Term 2</th><th class="n">Term 3</th><th class="n">Annual</th><th>Decision</th></tr></thead>
              <tbody id="prRows"></tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
          <div class="pr-apply">
            <button type="button" class="btn" id="prApply">Apply promotion</button>
            <span class="muted" id="prApplyNote"></span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
  </div>

  <script src="/js/app.js"></script>
  <script src="/js/toast.js"></script>
  <script src="/js/school-identity.js"></script>
  <script src="/js/i18n-fr-app.js"></script>
  <script src="/js/i18n.js"></script>
  <script src="/js/notify-bell.js"></script>
  <script src="/js/admin-shell.js"></script>
  <script src="/js/promotion.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
